Package: kaspexample
Type: Project
Title: KASP Marker Design for Arabidopsis thaliana (TAIR10)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lecture", "Demo", email = "demo@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An opinionated, reproducible pipeline for designing and quality
    controlling Kompetitive Allele-Specific PCR (KASP) genotyping assays for
    Arabidopsis thaliana. Pulls the TAIR10 genome (BSgenome), 1001 Genomes
    variation (Ensembl REST), picks candidate allele-specific and common
    primers (primer3 via reticulate), and scores thermodynamics, allelic
    discrimination and genome-wide specificity (BLAST via rBLAST).
